Maintainer: Kelly McCuddy <graewolf@use.startmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/kmccuddy/sartoria

Package: sartoria-nvidia
Architecture: all
Depends: sartoria-desktop (>= 0.0.4),
         nvidia-driver,
         nvidia-kernel-dkms,
         linux-headers-amd64,
         firmware-nvidia-gsp,
         nvidia-smi,
         nvidia-modprobe,
         mesa-utils,
         pciutils,
         ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: bumblebee, bumblebee-nvidia
Recommends: nvidia-vulkan-icd
Description: Sartoria hybrid NVIDIA (Prime offload)
 Proprietary NVIDIA kernel module and Prime render offload for
 Sartoria on hybrid AMD/Intel + NVIDIA laptops. The session stays
 on the iGPU (Mesa). Use `sartoria nvidia <cmd>` to offload.
 Not for virtio/QEMU. Not Bumblebee. Not nvidia-xconfig --prime.
